  "created": "2026-05-23T04:19:16.953Z",
  "description": "ZawkMapper by ZawkTech is a fast, lightweight .NET object mapper and C# DTO mapping library for runtime object mapping, EF Core IQueryable projection, SQL-friendly ProjectAs queries, nested object mapping, collection mapping, strict same-type mapping, direct mapping, and flexible runtime conversion. It is designed as a clean AutoMapper alternative for developers who want simple MapModel, ProjectModel, MapField, MapFieldStrict, MapFieldDirect, and ProjectAs APIs.",
