  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "ZawkMapper 0.6.1 is the stable release of the tested 0.6.1 release candidate. It improves common runtime object mapping paths, reduces allocation in same-type and direct mapping scenarios, keeps ProjectAs projection behavior stable, and adds clearer public documentation for MapField, MapFieldStrict, MapFieldDirect, MapModel, ProjectModel, named mappings, EF Core projection, and nested mapping guidance.",
